# Deployment records. The local ones are regenerated from scratch on every run and
# say nothing -- addresses on an in-memory chain are deterministic and meaningless.
# A record of what went to a REAL network is the opposite: it is the only durable
# answer to "what is actually deployed, and what was it pointed at". Keep those.
deployments/hardhat.json
deployments/localhost.json
deployments/splitters-hardhat.json
deployments/splitters-localhost.json

